  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "Uyrh3I_XbpET2aA4EiDmu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 312,
      "y": 317.2,
      "width": 1102.52734375,
      "height": 194.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1912386116,
      "version": 69,
      "versionNonce": 496012100,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776673273975,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. Crew Planning & Rostering - Create optimized schedules, pairings, monthly rosters, standby coverage, and duty allocations.\n2. Real-Time Crew Recovery - Reassign crew instantly during delays, cancellations, sickness, no-shows, or disruptions.\n3. Qualification & Compliance Validation - Verify licenses, medicals, certifications, visa/passport validity, route/fleet qualifications, and legality rules.\n4. Duty Time & Fatigue Management - Enforce regulatory rest hours, maximum duty hours, and fatigue risk policies.\n5. Crew Mobile Self-Service - Provide roster access, notifications, acknowledgements, leave requests, and assignment updates.\n6. Integration with Airline Core Systems - Connect with Flight Ops, HR, Passenger Service System, Departure Control System, OCC, and payroll systems.\n7. Operational Dashboards & Audit Trail - Real-time visibility of crew status, shortages, KPIs, approvals, overrides, and history.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n\n1. Crew Planning & Rostering - Create optimized schedules, pairings, monthly rosters, standby coverage, and duty allocations.\n2. Real-Time Crew Recovery - Reassign crew instantly during delays, cancellations, sickness, no-shows, or disruptions.\n3. Qualification & Compliance Validation - Verify licenses, medicals, certifications, visa/passport validity, route/fleet qualifications, and legality rules.\n4. Duty Time & Fatigue Management - Enforce regulatory rest hours, maximum duty hours, and fatigue risk policies.\n5. Crew Mobile Self-Service - Provide roster access, notifications, acknowledgements, leave requests, and assignment updates.\n6. Integration with Airline Core Systems - Connect with Flight Ops, HR, Passenger Service System, Departure Control System, OCC, and payroll systems.\n7. Operational Dashboards & Audit Trail - Real-time visibility of crew status, shortages, KPIs, approvals, overrides, and history.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "dXcePrDaodXn0jD3H6XLR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 311.894287109375,
      "y": 565.8397216796875,
      "width": 652.3673706054688,
      "height": 172.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 886451196,
      "version": 152,
      "versionNonce": 1142116804,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776673410266,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non - Functiona Requirement:\n\n1. High Availability\n2. Scalability\n3. Performance - Crew search, legality checks, and reassignment decisions within seconds.\n4. Reliability & Resilience- Fault tolerance, retry mechanisms, failover, and no data loss.\n5. Observability\n6. Maintainability & Extensibility",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non - Functiona Requirement:\n\n1. High Availability\n2. Scalability\n3. Performance - Crew search, legality checks, and reassignment decisions within seconds.\n4. Reliability & Resilience- Fault tolerance, retry mechanisms, failover, and no data loss.\n5. Observability\n6. Maintainability & Extensibility",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "4mYi9WSq7MjRHAHeq3Ya-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -419,
      "y": 331,
      "width": 500.46356201171875,
      "height": 1468.8000000000002,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1191023356,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 255460348,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776691582171,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Assume a mid-to-large airline such as Etihad Airways:\n\nAircraft Fleet: 120 → 180 aircraft\nDaily Flights: 500 → 800 flights/day\nCrew Members: 8,000 → 15,000 employees\nConcurrent OCC / Control Users: 300–500 users\nMobile Crew Users: 10,000+ users\nPeak Disruption Windows: 2x–3x normal load\n2. Core Transaction Volumes\nCrew Rostering / Planning\nMonthly roster generation for 8k–15k crew\nMillions of rule checks during optimization runs\nReal-Time Operations\n\nPer day:\n\n500–800 flight events\n10k+ crew status updates\n20k+ mobile app interactions\n5k–15k notifications\n1k–3k schedule changes / swaps\nDuring Major Disruption\n10x spike in reassignment checks\nHundreds of concurrent controller actions\nThousands of alerts in short time window\n3. Data Volume Estimate\nOperational Data Store (Hot Data)\nCurrent roster\nCurrent crew location/status\nActive disruptions\nFlight status\n\nEstimate:\n\n200 GB – 1 TB active operational dataset\nHistorical / Analytics Lake\nEvents\nAudit logs\nRosters\nCrew utilization history\nDelay/recovery decisions\n\nEstimate:\n\n5–20 TB over 5 years\n4. Performance Targets\nUser Experience\nDashboard load: < 2 sec\nCrew search: < 1 sec\nLegality validation: < 3 sec\nReassignment workflow: < 5 sec\nBackend\nEvent processing latency: near real-time (< few sec)\n5. Availability Targets\n99.95%+ for operational control modules\nDR with multi-region failover\nRPO near zero for transactional data\n6. Recommended Scalable Design\nCompute\nContainerized microservices on Kubernetes / managed cloud platform\nAuto-scale for disruption peaks\nData\nOLTP DB for crew transactions\nCache for crew lookup\nStreaming backbone for events\nLakehouse for analytics\nMessaging\nEvent bus with retry / DLQ / replay",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Assume a mid-to-large airline such as Etihad Airways:\n\nAircraft Fleet: 120 → 180 aircraft\nDaily Flights: 500 → 800 flights/day\nCrew Members: 8,000 → 15,000 employees\nConcurrent OCC / Control Users: 300–500 users\nMobile Crew Users: 10,000+ users\nPeak Disruption Windows: 2x–3x normal load\n2. Core Transaction Volumes\nCrew Rostering / Planning\nMonthly roster generation for 8k–15k crew\nMillions of rule checks during optimization runs\nReal-Time Operations\n\nPer day:\n\n500–800 flight events\n10k+ crew status updates\n20k+ mobile app interactions\n5k–15k notifications\n1k–3k schedule changes / swaps\nDuring Major Disruption\n10x spike in reassignment checks\nHundreds of concurrent controller actions\nThousands of alerts in short time window\n3. Data Volume Estimate\nOperational Data Store (Hot Data)\nCurrent roster\nCurrent crew location/status\nActive disruptions\nFlight status\n\nEstimate:\n\n200 GB – 1 TB active operational dataset\nHistorical / Analytics Lake\nEvents\nAudit logs\nRosters\nCrew utilization history\nDelay/recovery decisions\n\nEstimate:\n\n5–20 TB over 5 years\n4. Performance Targets\nUser Experience\nDashboard load: < 2 sec\nCrew search: < 1 sec\nLegality validation: < 3 sec\nReassignment workflow: < 5 sec\nBackend\nEvent processing latency: near real-time (< few sec)\n5. Availability Targets\n99.95%+ for operational control modules\nDR with multi-region failover\nRPO near zero for transactional data\n6. Recommended Scalable Design\nCompute\nContainerized microservices on Kubernetes / managed cloud platform\nAuto-scale for disruption peaks\nData\nOLTP DB for crew transactions\nCache for crew lookup\nStreaming backbone for events\nLakehouse for analytics\nMessaging\nEvent bus with retry / DLQ / replay",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
